    "faq_WXQQJh": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_74YWhi": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. Is the Merach Q3 Magnetic Rowing Machine quiet enough for flats?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The Merach Q3 uses a magnetic resistance system and operates at a noise level of under 40 dB, making it exceptionally quiet. This makes it ideal for home workouts in flats or shared households without disturbing family members or neighbours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3gktY6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. Does the Merach Q3 rowing machine require a power connection?",
            "content": "<p>No. The Merach Q3 features a self-powered system, so no power cable is required. The machine generates energy during your workout and can even charge a smartphone or other devices via a 15 W Type-C port.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_AH6maM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. How strong is the resistance on the Merach Q3 rowing machine?",
            "content": "<p>The Merach Q3 offers a maximum magnetic resistance of up to 60 kg with 16 adjustable resistance levels. This makes it suitable for light endurance training as well as more intensive workouts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_4G8wQA": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Is the Merach Q3 suitable for taller or heavier users?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The rowing machine features an extended 100 cm dual wooden rail, providing greater range of motion and comfort. It is suitable for users up to around 1.95 m tall and supports a maximum user weight of up to 181 kg.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Dk8ygp": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. Can I track my workout data on the Merach Q3?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The extra-large HD LED display clearly shows key workout data such as time, distance, strokes and calories. You can also connect the machine via Bluetooth to the MERACH App, Kinomap, Zwift, Apple Health or Google Fit to track your training data in real time.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "item_74YWhi",
